<title>UK: Rank jumps on shr buyback, Xerox sale.</title>
<headline>Rank jumps on shr buyback, Xerox sale.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Rank Group Plc jumped on Friday after the UK leisure concern said it would buy back shares and sell its stake in Rank Xerox to Xerox Corp, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were up 21p to 443-1/2p at 1348 GMT, having climbed as high as 450p immediately after Rank made the announcement.</p>
<p>The company said it would spend up to 250 million stg on the share buyback, and would sell its 20 percent stake in the office equipment joint venture to Xerox for one billion pounds.</p>
<p>&quot;The market had been hoping for something like this,&quot; said one market maker.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
